UID:7AkHrDDJDS
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 180 mins (3h00m)\n\nPresented by CREATE48 Media Net
 work & Harbor Island Studios. Celebrate the creativity\, teamwork\, and fi
 lmmaking talent of Seattle’s 48 Hour Film Project community. This high
 -energy awards show honors standout films\, performances\, writing\, direc
 ting\, and technical achievements—all created under the thrilling pressu
 re of a single unforgettable weekend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-th
 eaters/seattle-48-hour-film-project-awards-show\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
